<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Golf-Gibson holds one shot lead at Masters.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Golf-Gibson holds one shot lead at Masters.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Rick Gibson has taken a one shot lead at 11 under par after firing a second round 68 at the Australian Masters at Huntingdale.</p>
<p>American Tiger Woods, the tournament favourite, trails the leader by three shots on eight under after completing a second round 70.</p>
<p>Gibson holds a one stroke advantage over Australians Robert Allenby and Peter O'Mally on 10 under.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
